From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [EXPERIMENT B] Add a shared path-aware tool-directory diagnostic

Base: astral-sh/uv@95637ecf70cbf3c8a8d11f424b9a654e8fefdf51

This is an internal design sketch, not an upstream submission.

The lower-level tool error retains the offending directory path and implements
uv's standard `Hint` trait. The central diagnostic walker learns `uv_tool::Error`.
`tool upgrade --all` adds operation context and propagates the error normally.

---
 crates/uv-tool/Cargo.toml                    |  1 +
 crates/uv-tool/src/lib.rs                    | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++--
 crates/uv/src/commands/diagnostics.rs        |  1 +
 crates/uv/src/commands/tool/upgrade.rs       |  7 +++----
 crates/uv/tests/tool/tool_upgrade.rs         | 14 +++++++++-----
 5 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

